    "- Upload real SAR Tiles shapefile, RW\n",
    "- For sample area slo_aoi, choose an example SAR date, and choose appropriate NAIP year, CO\n",
    "-- Select for merging only the adjacent NAIP tiles for that year, CO\n",
    "~~build vrt for single mosaic, RW~~\n",
    "- ~~Clip naip mosaic to tile bounds, RW~~\n",
    "- ~~resample clipped image to 1000 x 1000 px, RW~~\n",
    "- ~~save to .tif~~\n",
    "\n",
    "  DEM:\n",
    "- set Planetary computer search to dem collection, RW\n",
    "- determine if adjacent tiles, and build vrt, if needed, (Same process as above)\n",
    "- resample, clip, save to tif (Same process as above)\n"
   ]
  },
